{
  "sn35.121:0.1": "Linked Discourses 35.121 ",
  "sn35.121:0.2": "12. The World and the Kinds of Sensual Stimulation ",
  "sn35.121:0.3": "Advice to Rāhula ",
  "sn35.121:1.1": "At one time the Buddha was staying near Sāvatthī in Jeta’s Grove, Anāthapiṇḍika’s monastery. ",
  "sn35.121:1.2": "Then as he was in private retreat this thought came to his mind, ",
  "sn35.121:1.3": "“The qualities that ripen in freedom have ripened in Rāhula. ",
  "sn35.121:1.4": "Why don’t I lead him further to the ending of defilements?” ",
  "sn35.121:1.5": "Then the Buddha robed up in the morning and, taking his bowl and robe, wandered for alms in Sāvatthī. ",
  "sn35.121:1.6": "After the meal, on his return from almsround, he addressed Venerable Rāhula, ",
  "sn35.121:1.7": "“Rāhula, get your sitting cloth. ",
  "sn35.121:1.8": "Let’s go to the Dark Forest for the day’s meditation.” ",
  "sn35.121:1.9": "“Yes, sir,” replied Rāhula. Taking his sitting cloth he followed behind the Buddha. ",
  "sn35.121:2.1": "Now at that time many thousands of deities followed the Buddha, thinking, ",
  "sn35.121:2.2": "“Today the Buddha will lead Rāhula further to the ending of defilements!” ",
  "sn35.121:2.3": "Then the Buddha plunged deep into the Dark Forest and sat at the root of a tree on the seat spread out. ",
  "sn35.121:2.4": "Rāhula bowed to the Buddha and sat down to one side. ",
  "sn35.121:2.5": "The Buddha said to him: ",
  "sn35.121:3.1": "“What do you think, Rāhula? ",
  "sn35.121:3